{"ref":"BDB, בִּזָּה²","hw":"בִּזָּה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּזָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. spoil, booty</strong>(late)—<span dir=\"rtl\">בִּזָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.13\">2 Ch 14:13</a> + 9 times;—<em>spoil, prey</em>, of things <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.14\">2 Ch 28:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:10\" href=\"/Esther.9.10\">Est 9:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:15\" href=\"/Esther.9.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:16\" href=\"/Esther.9.16\">16</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.13\">2 Ch 14:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.13\">25:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:24\" href=\"/Daniel.11.24\">Dn 11:24</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלָל</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">רכושׁ</span>); n. verb., <em>spoiling</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:7\" href=\"/Ezra.9.7\">Ezr 9:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:33\" href=\"/Daniel.11.33\">Dn 11:33</a>, cf. also <span dir=\"rtl\">לְב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.36\">Ne 3:36</a>.","next":"BDB, בִּזָּיוֹן²","prev":"BDB, בַּז²"}